to plant misleading evidence

20
00:00:58.101 --> 00:01:00.190
at the scene,
including a weapon.

21
00:01:00.234 --> 00:01:04.151
All across the city
and the nation,
including Swinton,

22
00:01:04.194 --> 00:01:05.761
