23
00:01:05.804 --> 00:01:07.763
have erupted to decry
the verdict,

24
00:01:07.806 --> 00:01:10.809
as well as to protest
police violence.

25
00:01:10.853 --> 00:01:13.247
At the courthouse,
activists gathered outside

26
00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.771
and marched through downtown.

27
00:01:15.814 --> 00:01:20.384
Various peaceful protests
escalated, as objects
were thrown at City Hall,

28
00:01:20.428 --> 00:01:23.126
as well as several
police vehicles.

29
00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:25.911
At least 14 people
were arrested.

30
00:01:25.955 --> 00:01:28.827
Three officers have been
treated for wounds,
